WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:03.600
Because of that fate, Lady Mirred has
been a sacrificial victim here

00:03.600 --> 00:06.330
all her life up till now.

00:06.330 --> 00:10.170
But if you can gather all the key spirits,

00:10.170 --> 00:12.800
Lady Mirred can be free.

00:16.110 --> 00:17.380
What are those?

00:17.380 --> 00:20.880
Zed, I want to try entrusting my wishes to you...

00:20.880 --> 00:25.340
...you who have been chosen by Amir Gaul.

00:39.630 --> 00:47.240
Far away from the town where I was born

00:47.240 --> 00:50.410
I am singing

00:50.410 --> 00:58.050
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

00:58.050 --> 01:01.320
Away in my pocket

01:01.320 --> 01:06.860
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:06.860 --> 01:11.900
Toward the unknown road

01:11.900 --> 01:17.340
I'll walk

01:17.340 --> 01:22.740
I'll move forward

01:22.740 --> 01:27.580
Not for someone else's sake

01:27.580 --> 01:33.050
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:33.050 --> 01:38.530
Just as the sun rises at dawn

01:38.530 --> 01:43.770
I pick out a melody with my voice

01:43.770 --> 01:47.790
Ephemerally yet strongly

01:49.440 --> 01:52.960
I live

01:59.610 --> 02:03.380
Episode 47
A Savior Adrift

02:06.290 --> 02:07.910
Sachura...

02:08.890 --> 02:12.190
Are you Noah?

02:14.000 --> 02:15.730
You're Noah, aren't you?!

02:15.730 --> 02:17.530
Aren't you?!

02:18.030 --> 02:19.660
Sachura...

02:20.030 --> 02:21.660
Noah!

02:28.980 --> 02:30.600
Amir Gaul!

02:40.160 --> 02:41.780
Noah...

03:00.580 --> 03:02.700
I'd know those eyes anywhere.

03:03.850 --> 03:07.300
Noah, where have you been?

03:08.250 --> 03:10.220
Get him, Sachura.

03:19.730 --> 03:21.350
Amir Gaul!

03:22.900 --> 03:26.570
Today's the day I'll get Amir Gaul back from you.

03:26.570 --> 03:28.200
Monadi!

03:34.740 --> 03:37.080
What are you doing, Lord Dolga?

03:37.080 --> 03:38.880
Defeat him.

03:46.290 --> 03:47.910
Noah...

03:49.520 --> 03:53.320
Noah, this is Shadin,
the spirit Sagiri entrusted me with!

04:00.640 --> 04:04.440
I see, so he has Shadin too, eh?

04:05.870 --> 04:08.500
He's saved me some trouble collecting it.

04:26.830 --> 04:28.030
Listen up, Noah!

04:28.030 --> 04:31.170
I'm never handing over Amir Gaul!

04:31.170 --> 04:34.620
I'm going to end this pointless warring!

04:35.240 --> 04:37.530
So please, you stop too!

04:40.070 --> 04:42.710
Stop it, I'll be the one to defeat him.

04:42.710 --> 04:45.010
And you'll wreck the castle too,
if this goes on too long.

04:45.010 --> 04:46.810
It's a waste of time!

04:57.430 --> 04:59.460
Xeem...

04:59.460 --> 05:03.590
Now, why don't I just take Amir Gaul?

05:15.010 --> 05:18.410
Amir Gaul and Shadin are in my hands.

05:18.410 --> 05:21.220
Now, I have four.

05:21.220 --> 05:24.670
All that's left is to find Lady Mirred.

05:25.420 --> 05:27.550
Just where could she have...

05:28.990 --> 05:32.290
But when it comes down to it,
her wings are clipped.

05:32.290 --> 05:36.200
She can't escape the cage of fate,

05:36.200 --> 05:38.170
no matter what.

05:38.700 --> 05:43.270
Lord Dolga, how about you hand over
your key spirit as well?

05:43.270 --> 05:45.370
It is not yet time.

05:45.370 --> 05:46.370
What?

05:46.370 --> 05:50.330
I shall give it to you when Lady Mirred returns.

06:05.130 --> 06:08.230
What do you mean,
you want to go back to the castle?!

06:08.230 --> 06:11.300
It's about time I end my selfishness.

06:11.300 --> 06:14.000
I've made wonderful memories.

06:14.000 --> 06:15.970
I'm satisfied now.

06:16.500 --> 06:18.300
Please, wait!

06:18.710 --> 06:20.480
Depending on Zed's success,

06:20.480 --> 06:24.430
you may be saved from the savior's fate!

06:25.150 --> 06:27.180
If that happens, you'll be free.

06:27.180 --> 06:29.480
You can see as much sky as you want!

06:29.480 --> 06:33.020
Can such a thing really happen?

06:33.020 --> 06:39.090
To become the savior is my fate as
the one born with a key spirit.

06:39.090 --> 06:41.860
To say that could be changed...

06:41.860 --> 06:45.160
It's not impossible.

06:50.840 --> 06:53.470
Please wait a little longer,

06:53.470 --> 06:56.270
at least until the end of this song.

07:06.290 --> 07:10.290
I want to save you,

07:10.290 --> 07:13.090
so that you can live your life freely!

07:30.680 --> 07:32.650
Master Dolga...

07:40.320 --> 07:41.890
Damn it...

07:41.890 --> 07:45.030
He got Amir Gaul from me.

07:45.030 --> 07:46.820
What do I do?

07:50.160 --> 07:53.960
Noah, what the heck are you after?

07:56.470 --> 07:58.100
You!

07:58.640 --> 08:00.610
Go ahead, escape.

08:00.610 --> 08:02.510
What?

08:02.510 --> 08:05.250
You have something you want to do, correct?

08:05.250 --> 08:08.050
What are you plotting?

08:08.050 --> 08:11.150
I'm not " plotting" anything, particularly.

08:11.150 --> 08:14.620
I just think that through granting your wish,

08:14.620 --> 08:16.790
my wish will be granted as well.

08:16.790 --> 08:19.260
That's all.

08:20.560 --> 08:23.690
I don't really get it,
but I don't have time to hesitate.

08:24.330 --> 08:26.800
I want to see him as soon as I can.

08:29.100 --> 08:32.400
Please, grant my wish.

08:35.310 --> 08:37.780
Tell me where Noah is.

08:37.780 --> 08:39.610
Noah?

08:39.610 --> 08:41.580
Who might that be?

08:53.460 --> 08:57.090
I wonder if Zed's gotten to see Noah?

08:59.000 --> 09:00.630
Noah...

09:09.080 --> 09:10.870
Who is it?

09:12.380 --> 09:15.350
What are you doing here?

09:16.080 --> 09:19.520
Noah, what are you after?

09:19.520 --> 09:22.150
Why the hell are you dressed like a Tuskan?

09:23.120 --> 09:25.590
Answer me, Noah!

09:26.960 --> 09:31.170
Zed, I knew we'd meet again.

09:31.170 --> 09:35.630
Noah, what the hell happened after that war?

09:39.240 --> 09:41.540
Neotopia collapsed,

09:41.540 --> 09:45.510
and I lost the supporting pillar of Absolute Law.

09:45.510 --> 09:50.140
For me, it was almost as if I had lost everything.

09:51.020 --> 09:54.860
But I had just one thing left.

09:54.860 --> 09:57.990
My "self," the same self as when we were in Calm.

09:57.990 --> 10:00.460
That alone.

10:02.130 --> 10:06.090
The self that is laughably weak and frail.

10:07.070 --> 10:10.140
I want an unwavering strength,

10:10.140 --> 10:13.940
an absolute strength that I can never lose.

10:14.840 --> 10:19.970
So, I've decided to gather all the key spirits.

10:20.880 --> 10:24.020
Noah, you...

10:24.020 --> 10:26.320
So, I'll make use of Tusk.

10:26.320 --> 10:30.280
I'll do whatever it takes to get the key spirits.

10:31.630 --> 10:35.130
Even kill you, if that's what it takes.

10:35.130 --> 10:36.960
What are you talking about, Noah?!

10:36.960 --> 10:41.470
Have even you been lost in the
spirits' temptation to evil?!

10:41.470 --> 10:43.300
Snap out of it, Noah!

10:43.300 --> 10:46.010
Sagiri's really worried about you too!

10:46.010 --> 10:47.610
" Sagiri" ?

10:47.610 --> 10:50.240
I've forgotten that name.

10:50.810 --> 10:52.180
Noah!

10:52.180 --> 10:54.120
There he is! The escapee!

10:54.120 --> 10:54.520
After him!

10:54.520 --> 10:56.140
Don't let him get away!
After him!

10:58.790 --> 11:00.580
After him!

11:11.170 --> 11:13.130
Hi there, Roya.

11:14.970 --> 11:17.600
Master Zico! Master Sebastian!

11:19.670 --> 11:22.510
How's the nursing going?

11:22.510 --> 11:25.050
Great, I got into the swing of it right away.

11:25.050 --> 11:27.010
It's very rewarding work.

11:27.010 --> 11:28.640
Good!

11:32.250 --> 11:33.420
Master Zico...

11:33.420 --> 11:35.220
Yes?

11:35.220 --> 11:38.190
We haven't heard anything from him since,
you know?

11:41.630 --> 11:42.630
I...

11:42.630 --> 11:49.070
Zed is walking his own path on
his own power right now.

11:49.070 --> 11:54.200
He's facing the fate he's been
burdened with head-on.

11:55.810 --> 11:58.440
The fate he's been burdened with?

12:00.050 --> 12:04.180
Right now, we just have to watch and wait.

12:07.420 --> 12:09.990
Gitra, I'm sorry.

12:09.990 --> 12:14.500
I let your kindness go to waste.

12:14.500 --> 12:16.790
Even Amir Gaul was stolen from me.

12:17.630 --> 12:19.300
I was right...

12:19.300 --> 12:22.100
In the end, fate does not change.

12:22.870 --> 12:24.810
Lady Mirred...

12:24.810 --> 12:26.440
I'm going back to the castle.

12:26.440 --> 12:30.710
Gitra, it will be trouble for you if I stay.

12:30.710 --> 12:32.380
Nonsense!

12:32.380 --> 12:36.380
Besides, I'm already a traitor.

12:36.380 --> 12:40.010
Let's think for a little longer about what we can do.

12:41.560 --> 12:43.560
It doesn't matter anymore.

12:43.560 --> 12:45.660
Let's return to the castle.

12:45.660 --> 12:47.460
Get ready.

12:48.200 --> 12:50.160
Lady Mirred...

12:58.870 --> 13:02.830
Do you really mean to go back to the castle?

13:03.640 --> 13:10.050
If you are the savior,
do you intend to accept that fate?

13:10.050 --> 13:14.090
Yeah, because I'm sick of the fighting.

13:14.090 --> 13:18.550
I don't want to see more people
dying or being hurt.

13:19.760 --> 13:21.730
I don't want to see it anymore.

13:22.430 --> 13:27.730
So, I'm going to gather all the key spirits,
and end this warring.

13:28.870 --> 13:33.740
I have unease and fear about
becoming the savior.

13:33.740 --> 13:37.650
I'm just not able to desire being
the savior out of compassion.

13:37.650 --> 13:40.780
This isn't compassion or whatever.

13:40.780 --> 13:43.520
I just can't forgive this stuff, that's all.

13:43.520 --> 13:45.310
You are strong.

13:46.850 --> 13:48.290
After I came to this world,

13:48.290 --> 13:51.920
I was totally focused on this vague
search for strength.

13:52.790 --> 13:55.500
I feel like when I've ended all the warring,

13:55.500 --> 13:59.100
I can become truly strong.

13:59.100 --> 14:02.900
I'm sure the strength I want must be there.

14:04.440 --> 14:06.740
True strength...

14:09.180 --> 14:11.750
I wanted to get away from that stifling town

14:11.750 --> 14:14.210
and feel a free wind.

14:15.520 --> 14:17.640
That was all.

14:18.620 --> 14:21.420
I'm the same.

14:21.420 --> 14:24.330
I just wanted to be free.

14:24.330 --> 14:27.620
I wanted to see the sky stretching out endlessly.

14:30.500 --> 14:34.300
I don't really get the whole "fate" thing yet,

14:34.300 --> 14:36.640
but if you want to be free...

14:36.640 --> 14:38.340
Lady Mirred...

14:38.340 --> 14:40.310
The preparations are finished.

14:40.840 --> 14:43.010
I see...

14:43.010 --> 14:46.810
Would you mind leaving me alone
for just a little bit?

14:47.650 --> 14:49.620
All right.

14:57.060 --> 14:59.530
We haven't even found Mirred yet,

14:59.530 --> 15:02.000
and you let the boy escape too?!

15:02.000 --> 15:03.660
This is a disgrace!

15:03.660 --> 15:05.430
Is Dukeham not back yet?!

15:05.430 --> 15:06.470
N..No, sir.

15:06.470 --> 15:09.040
We have not even received word from him.

15:09.040 --> 15:10.140
Damn it...

15:10.140 --> 15:11.970
What is that man doing?

15:11.970 --> 15:13.810
Xeem!

15:13.810 --> 15:17.010
What brings you all the way here, Elmeida?

15:17.010 --> 15:21.580
After Hugh's death,
I left Zymot's control to Zaddock.

15:21.580 --> 15:24.920
All you have to do is keep him
under your observation.

15:24.920 --> 15:27.120
Oh, don't be so harsh.

15:27.120 --> 15:29.420
You're as cold as ever, I see.

15:30.720 --> 15:31.730
More importantly,

15:31.730 --> 15:33.850
is Lord Dolga being of use to you?

15:35.460 --> 15:37.590
What are you trying to say?

15:38.570 --> 15:41.700
You'd best get Lord Dolga's key spirit

15:41.700 --> 15:44.500
as soon as you can.

15:44.870 --> 15:47.670
What is this about, Elmeida?

15:51.080 --> 15:53.550
What? Mirred's gone?

15:53.550 --> 15:55.050
Where did she go?

15:55.050 --> 15:58.650
Probably the Cave of Toste.

15:58.650 --> 15:59.720
Where's that?

15:59.720 --> 16:02.850
If Xeem's people find her first, it's all over!

16:16.370 --> 16:18.840
So, you came back here.

16:19.170 --> 16:20.980
Master Dolga!

16:20.980 --> 16:26.150
As always, this is a false starry sky.

16:26.150 --> 16:28.120
That's all right with me.

16:28.120 --> 16:31.450
I just wanted to see it one more time.

16:31.450 --> 16:33.920
It appears you have made up your mind.

16:33.920 --> 16:36.550
In that case, I'll escort you to the castle.

16:38.390 --> 16:40.190
What is it?

16:40.190 --> 16:44.200
Even if this is a false starry sky,

16:44.200 --> 16:46.500
you are not false.

16:47.800 --> 16:49.300
Master Dolga...

16:49.300 --> 16:51.770
Who in the world are you?

16:52.940 --> 16:55.910
You rescued me.

16:55.910 --> 16:59.510
And you taught me many things.

16:59.510 --> 17:02.350
This beautiful cave...

17:02.350 --> 17:07.650
And an emotion I never knew before...

17:11.230 --> 17:14.090
If the choice were allowed me,

17:14.090 --> 17:16.530
I wouldn't to return to the castle.

17:16.530 --> 17:19.990
I don't want to bear the fate of the savior, either!

17:20.730 --> 17:23.030
I want to be free.

17:25.340 --> 17:29.740
I'd like to set you free, if I could,

17:29.740 --> 17:33.040
but I am in Xeem's employ.

17:34.180 --> 17:36.020
However...

17:36.020 --> 17:38.990
There is just one way you could be free.

17:39.520 --> 17:42.360
Give me your key spirit.

17:42.360 --> 17:44.430
My key spirit?!

17:44.430 --> 17:49.230
I have been chosen by a key spirit,
just like you.

17:50.100 --> 17:51.800
It can't be...

17:51.800 --> 17:53.700
No...

17:53.700 --> 17:58.710
I will gather all the key spirits and
gain Absolute Strength,

17:58.710 --> 18:02.330
and I will become the savior of this world.

18:03.910 --> 18:06.080
Give me your key spirit.

18:06.080 --> 18:09.480
If you do that, you can evade your fate.

18:09.480 --> 18:11.320
You can be free.

18:11.320 --> 18:14.290
Now, give me the key spirit.

18:16.190 --> 18:20.820
Were you after it all along?

18:21.260 --> 18:22.630
Come on, hurry.

18:22.630 --> 18:24.260
Don't give it to him!
Come on, hurry.

18:26.000 --> 18:27.500
Stop, Mirred!

18:27.500 --> 18:29.900
You can't give him the key spirit!

18:29.900 --> 18:31.530
Zed!

18:32.540 --> 18:35.140
Noah, you're wrong.

18:35.140 --> 18:36.340
You can seek power,

18:36.340 --> 18:38.940
but only destruction will be waiting for you!

18:39.010 --> 18:41.720
What you want just doesn't exist!

18:41.720 --> 18:44.920
I'm going to get Absolute Strength!

18:44.920 --> 18:46.720
Now, hand it over!

18:46.720 --> 18:47.820
Hurry up!

18:47.820 --> 18:48.890
Lady Mirred!

18:48.890 --> 18:51.090
Wait, Gitra.

18:51.090 --> 18:56.220
Mirred, I'll take the fate you can't bear
and bear it for you!

18:58.000 --> 19:02.460
I don't want to see more people
dying or being hurt.

19:03.070 --> 19:08.030
So, I'm going to gather all the key spirits,
and end this warring.

19:12.180 --> 19:14.810
Hurry up and give it to me!

19:17.280 --> 19:18.910
Zed!

19:20.320 --> 19:22.920
Stop right there, Lady Mirred.

19:22.920 --> 19:24.320
Brother!

19:24.320 --> 19:25.950
Brother?

19:26.360 --> 19:27.460
Xeem...

19:27.460 --> 19:32.900
You can struggle all you want,
but you can't evade your fate.

19:32.900 --> 19:33.970
Xeem...

19:33.970 --> 19:35.640
Have you forgotten?

19:35.640 --> 19:39.910
Your power will quell all the chaos of this world.

19:39.910 --> 19:43.040
It will save all the people.

19:43.880 --> 19:47.080
You are a special person,

19:47.080 --> 19:52.490
but there is no need to fear the weight your fate.

19:52.490 --> 19:54.660
You have me.

19:54.660 --> 19:57.620
Me, who will share your fate.

19:58.790 --> 20:03.960
Lord Dolga, I know that you've betrayed me.

20:03.960 --> 20:06.760
Hand over your key spirit right now!

20:13.440 --> 20:15.070
Sachura!

20:42.600 --> 20:46.230
The key spirit Dynamis is awakening!

21:10.900 --> 21:14.700
Now, all the key spirits are gathered.

21:37.390 --> 21:39.560
At last...

21:39.560 --> 21:42.690
Tusker will be reborn!

22:00.880 --> 22:05.340
I..Is this him?

22:06.320 --> 22:09.120
Is this Great Tusker?

22:24.300 --> 22:26.310
It can't be...

22:26.310 --> 22:28.100
Has Tusker...

22:29.180 --> 22:35.950
Has Tusker been resurrected?

22:39.620 --> 22:42.020
I just wanted to get away

22:42.020 --> 22:44.920
From that troublesome place

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
And flap my wings

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
How many times have I scolded myself

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
For still being so immature?

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
I'll just move with all I've got

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Towards that promised place

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Ours are true wings

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Of very, very beautiful feathers

23:24.000 --> 23:26.700
So we won't succumb

23:26.700 --> 23:33.740
To even the greatest, most intense gust of wind

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
We must fly far, far away with all we've got

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
See, now we're one with the wind

23:49.560 --> 23:54.630
And we can look back and laugh at those days

23:54.630 --> 23:57.930
We choked back so many tears

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
All the way to the ends of the world

24:17.750 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Advent

24:18.150 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Advent"
